flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Load sample weighted graph]
    B --> C[Show menu]
    C --> D{Choice?}
    D -->|Display| E[Print adjacency list]
    D -->|Route| F[Read source and destination]
    F --> G[Initialize distances and min-priority queue]
    G --> H[Extract minimum-distance vertex]
    H --> I[Relax adjacent road edges]
    I --> J{Destination finalized or queue empty?}
    J -->|No| H
    J -->|Yes| K{Destination reachable?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Trace parent links and print route]
    K -->|No| M[Print no route]
    D -->|Update traffic| N[Validate and update road weight]
    D -->|BFS| O[Traverse reachable vertices with queue]
    D -->|Exit| P([End])
    E --> C
    L --> C
    M --> C
    N --> C
    O --> C
